            "notes": "You can start to flex here.\n\nStandard choice is [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4). Get [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) instead of [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) if you're rich.\n\nGet [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) or [Stratosphere Beacon](item_15bf2dc7-5161-47b0-929b-17cbb1d54182) if your team is having trouble with flying heroes.\n\nGet [Salvaged Slugs](item_019d6c60-36eb-42ec-8d6e-5bbb44a0db61) or [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) if there are too many heroes with armor and barriers.\n\nIf you can't afford everything, drop [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4) for [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2).",
